{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.luca.bare",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第二天的会场，她来得比谁都晚",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.luca.bare",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.luca.bare",
    "idolId": "luca",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "第二天的会场。椅子和线材堆在墙边，老板正在收拾。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "昨天真是麻烦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，设备很快就恢复了，您别太放在心上……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "text": "老板一直在道歉，说正演到一半出设备故障，实在不知道该怎么赔。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……多亏斑鳩在 MC 那边撑住了。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "她经验也够，应付这种状况应该是习惯了吧……真不愧是。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，是啊。不过────",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "习惯……也许不是那么回事。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "text": "手机响了。是音乐媒体那边。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是，一直承蒙关照……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "text": "对方说 live 报道的校样出来了，已经发到邮箱。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明白了，我马上确认。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "text": "对方说，真的是一场很厉害的 live，希望会场的气氛能传达到一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "text": "对方顿了顿，像是在找词。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "text": "然后说：和别的孩子不一样，是**生身**的，**毫无遮拦**的。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……谢谢。我会转告她。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "text": "挂了电话，他站在墙边等。等到灯都换成了夜间模式。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……今天也没来啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "至少给个信也好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "不知道…………那种事…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "live……反响很好。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说近期还想再请你来。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "手机。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "啊……？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果然还是那样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为修好了也会再裂……是这样吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "吵死了。"
      }
    }
  },
